Download Reference NUMTs:

UCSC Genome Browser → Table Browser → numt track for the relevant genome version.

Download Non-reference Germline NUMTs:

From PI’s PLOS Biology 2024 paper (likely supplementary tables).

From Wei et al., Nature NUMT paper.

Filter Your Data:

Remove anything overlapping with reference NUMTs.

Remove anything matching the published germline NUMTs.

The remaining calls are candidate somatic NUMTs.

HapMapmixing Benchmark:

Use the “truth set” once your PI provides it for validation.

Check Wang et al., MEI benchmarking paper:

Follow their workflow for filtering and benchmarking MEIs/NUMTs. This gives you a validated procedure to follow.
